  "title": "FLUX.1-schnell: text to image from the all-in-one checkpoint",
  "description": "Text to image with FLUX.1-schnell from Comfy-Org's all-in-one checkpoint, which holds the diffusion model, the T5-XXL and CLIP-L text encoders and the VAE; CheckpointLoaderSimple loads all four, as ComfyUI's own flux_schnell template does. Schnell is timestep-distilled: 4 steps at CFG 1.0, so the negative prompt is ignored; the template's empty negative CLIPTextEncode is kept. Width and height must be multiples of 16, EmptySD3LatentImage's step, about one megapixel; the contract check refuses a task size off it. The checkpoint has to be in checkpoints/, where CheckpointLoaderSimple looks (GAPS Q13).",
